From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:26:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] test(05-04): re-pin assemble function bodies after
 buildContext builds blocks

buildContext now collects the block list while rendering and returns it as a new
field, so the pinned region and its end literal changed. The removed lines are the
chunk render step and the return line only; the relevance filters, the refusal
decision and the context wrapper literals are untouched, and the differential,
oracle and characterization suites pass unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X342shLsAZx6PYph2vA7hc
---
 tests/legacy-post-filter-sentinel.test.ts | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tests/legacy-post-filter-sentinel.test.ts b/tests/legacy-post-filter-sentinel.test.ts
index 2104dec..a0f2d0d 100644
--- a/tests/legacy-post-filter-sentinel.test.ts
+++ b/tests/legacy-post-filter-sentinel.test.ts
@@ -62,8 +62,8 @@ const PINNED_REGIONS: PinnedRegion[] = [
     label: 'assemble function bodies (filterCandidates, buildContext)',
     file: 'assemble',
     start: 'export function filterCandidates<C extends AssemblyCandidate>(',
-    end: 'return { context, usedDocuments, relevantChunks, kept, queryTerms, sourceImages, links, refusalCandidate };\n}',
-    sha256: '1f9390ab31d184f4e27ee986494233bd859dc939f4f2047e71d4dc9ad7661c73',
+    end: 'return { context, usedDocuments, relevantChunks, kept, blocks, queryTerms, sourceImages, links, refusalCandidate };\n}',
+    sha256: 'ebb2e9def1530d0f3d3e7658ebb5911fb503be8d571cea4bfae45fcd94d031d5',
   },
 ];
 
